@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Guest / Customer" as User
participant "FieldsPage" as UI
participant "FieldOperationController" as Controller
participant "FieldOperationService" as Service
participant "FootballFieldRepository / FieldPriceRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-11: View Field Detail ==

User -> UI : 1. Select a field
activate User
activate UI

UI -> UI : 2. useEffect([selectedField.fieldId])
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> UI : 3. Validate form/filter state
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> Controller : 4. GET /api/fields/{fieldId}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. fieldDetail(fieldId)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. Resolve field; calculate price range
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. findById; findByField_FieldId
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT field and active field_price rows
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Field with prices
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Add services and next available slots
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Unknown field -> HTTP 404
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> UI : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI : 15. setFieldDetail(response.data)
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI --> User : 16. Open field detail modal

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
